This package is the DeepSeek Harness binding of `entropy-sdk`
(https://github.com/CYD-PRC/entropy-sdk), the embeddable distillation of the
EntropyRuntime paper (arXiv:2607.00334). `lib/core.js` is a JavaScript port of
that SDK's published core abstractions; the remaining modules bind those
abstractions to the DeepSeek Harness plugin APIs.

